"""Walter telemetry service.

One background collector polls a FIXED, server-side set of PromQL queries (plus llama-swap
/running and the backup marker) and caches a JSON snapshot. Every HTTP/SSE client is served
from that cache, so N viewers cost the same Prometheus load as one. The client can never send
PromQL: there is no endpoint that accepts a query.
"""

